  "intro": "We help Baltimore businesses get featured in the Baltimore Sun and other established Maryland publications. We develop the story, write it to each title's standard and manage the placement, and you approve every word.",
  "outlets": ["baltimore-sun"],
  "body": "<p>A PR agency in Baltimore helps your business appear in the publications that Maryland readers, customers and decision-makers rely on. For a Baltimore company, that typically means a well-shaped story in the city's best-known daily or a respected business title, giving you coverage you can share with clients, partners, investors and future hires.</p><p>Digital Networking Agency works with businesses in Baltimore remotely. We develop the angle, write the article to each publication's standard, manage the placement and send everything to you first, so you approve every word before it goes live. It means credible Maryland coverage without building a press function of your own.</p><h2 id=\"who-pr-in-baltimore-suits\">Who PR in Baltimore suits</h2><p>Baltimore's economy is anchored by medicine, research, the port and a strong base of professional services, alongside a lively community of independent businesses. We most often help:</p><ul><li><strong>Healthcare and life sciences companies</strong> working in the orbit of Johns Hopkins and the city's other hospitals and universities.</li><li><strong>Cybersecurity and technology firms</strong> serving federal agencies and defence contractors across central Maryland.</li><li><strong>Logistics, shipping and manufacturing businesses</strong> connected to the Port of Baltimore.</li><li><strong>Law firms, accountants and consultancies</strong> that want to be recognised as authorities in Maryland.</li><li><strong>Restaurants, retailers and neighbourhood businesses</strong> with a distinctive Baltimore story.</li></ul><h2 id=\"the-baltimore-media-landscape\">The Baltimore media landscape</h2><p>The Baltimore Sun is the city's long-established daily newspaper and the name most Marylanders associate with Baltimore news. It covers business, health, education, politics and culture, and a feature there gives a Baltimore business a strong piece of credibility that travels well beyond the city.</p><p>For business and legal audiences, the Maryland Daily Record covers law, property, finance and commerce across the state, making it a natural fit for professional firms and business-to-business companies. Elsewhere in Maryland, Herald-Mail Media serves Hagerstown and the western part of the state, while Delmarva Now covers the Eastern Shore and the wider Delmarva Peninsula. Together they help a Baltimore business reach customers well outside the city.</p><h2 id=\"what-stories-travel-in-baltimore\">What stories travel in Baltimore</h2><p>Baltimore readers are interested in progress, resilience and the people moving the city forward. Stories that connect your business to the city's strengths tend to do well. Angles we develop include:</p><ul><li>Medical research and health innovation that improves care for patients.</li><li>Cybersecurity and data protection, given the concentration of federal security work nearby.</li><li>Trade, shipping and logistics tied to the port and the distribution industry around it.</li><li>Investment in historic neighbourhoods, waterfront areas and redeveloped industrial buildings.</li><li>Local food, arts and culture, from crab houses to independent makers.</li></ul><p>Every good story needs a clear reason to run now. We look for the timely element in your business, such as an expansion, new jobs, a contract, a launch or a founder's informed view on the city's growth and challenges.</p><h2 id=\"baltimore-maryland-and-national-coverage\">Baltimore, Maryland and national coverage</h2><p>Many Baltimore businesses work across Maryland and the wider Mid-Atlantic, including the Washington area. Planning coverage in layers helps. A feature in the Baltimore Sun establishes you locally. The Maryland Daily Record builds your profile with business and legal readers state-wide, and titles such as Herald-Mail Media and Delmarva Now carry your story to other parts of Maryland. National business coverage then adds weight when you are speaking to investors, partners or customers elsewhere.</p><h2 id=\"how-it-works-with-dna\">How it works with DNA</h2><p>We start by understanding your business and your goals in Baltimore and beyond. We then recommend the Maryland publications that suit your story, develop the angle and write the article in the style each title expects. You review the draft and approve every word. Once approved, we manage the placement through to publication and send you the live coverage. The process takes weeks rather than days, and you stay informed throughout.</p><h2 id=\"publications-we-place-in-baltimore\">Publications we place in for Baltimore</h2>\n<p>These are the Baltimore titles we place clients in. Where a title has its own page, it explains what it publishes and how a feature there works.</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/baltimore-sun\">Baltimore Sun</a></li></ul>\n<h3>Across Maryland</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Maryland Daily Record</strong></li><li><strong>Delmarva Now</strong></li><li><strong>Herald-Mail Media</strong></li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"frequently-asked-questions\">Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Do I need a Baltimore PR agency to get local coverage?</h3><p>No. What matters is understanding Baltimore and Maryland media and writing to each publication's standard. We work with Baltimore businesses remotely and handle the whole process for you.</p><h3>How do I get featured in the Baltimore Sun?</h3><p>Start with a timely story that matters to Baltimore readers, such as growth, research, hiring or community investment. We develop it, write it to the paper's standard and manage the placement, and you approve the final text.</p><h3>What does a PR agency in Baltimore do?</h3><p>It finds the newsworthy angle in your business, prepares articles for Baltimore and Maryland publications and manages each placement. With DNA, you approve every word before anything goes live.</p>",
  "toc": [{"id": "who-pr-in-baltimore-suits", "text": "Who PR in Baltimore suits"}, {"id": "the-baltimore-media-landscape", "text": "The Baltimore media landscape"}, {"id": "what-stories-travel-in-baltimore", "text": "What stories travel in Baltimore"}, {"id": "baltimore-maryland-and-national-coverage", "text": "Baltimore, Maryland and national coverage"}, {"id": "how-it-works-with-dna", "text": "How it works with DNA"}, {"id": "publications-we-place-in-baltimore", "text": "Publications we place in for Baltimore"}, {"id": "frequently-asked-questions", "text": "Frequently asked questions"}],
