  "outlets": ["the-columbus-dispatch"],
  "body": "<p>A PR agency in Columbus helps your business reach the readers who matter in central Ohio: customers, local business leaders, investors and the graduates and professionals you want to hire. The aim is a credible, well-written article about your company in a publication Columbus readers already trust, so your coverage informs rather than sells.</p><p>Digital Networking Agency works with businesses in Columbus remotely. We develop the story, write it to each publication's standard, manage the placement and send the draft to you, so you approve every word before it goes live. It is a practical way to build recognised Ohio coverage without running an in-house press operation.</p><h2 id=\"who-pr-in-columbus-suits\">Who PR in Columbus suits</h2><p>Columbus has a broad economy built around government, education, insurance, retail and logistics, with a growing technology scene alongside. The businesses that benefit most from coverage include:</p><ul><li><strong>Technology and software start-ups</strong> growing in a city with a large pool of graduates from Ohio State.</li><li><strong>Insurance and financial services firms</strong> in a city long associated with the insurance industry.</li><li><strong>Retail, fashion and consumer brands</strong>, a sector with deep roots in the Columbus area.</li><li><strong>Logistics and distribution companies</strong> serving customers across the Midwest from central Ohio.</li><li><strong>Healthcare, property and professional services businesses</strong> meeting the needs of a growing region.</li></ul><h2 id=\"the-columbus-media-landscape\">The Columbus media landscape</h2><p>The Columbus Dispatch is the city's main daily newspaper and the title most central Ohio readers turn to for local news, business and politics. Because Columbus is the state capital, the paper also reaches people working in government and public policy. A feature in the Dispatch gives a Columbus business a strong piece of local credibility.</p><p>Columbus also has dedicated magazine titles. Columbus CEO focuses on the region's business community, covering leaders, companies and the trends shaping the local economy, which makes it a natural home for founder profiles and growth stories. Columbus Monthly covers life in the city more broadly, from food and culture to people and neighbourhoods. Around the region, the Newark Advocate, the Lancaster Eagle-Gazette and the Chillicothe Gazette serve communities within easy reach of Columbus.</p><h2 id=\"what-stories-travel-in-columbus\">What stories travel in Columbus</h2><p>Columbus readers respond to stories about growth, investment and the people building businesses in the city. Angles we develop regularly include:</p><ul><li>Technology companies scaling up in central Ohio and the talent they are hiring.</li><li>Data centres and advanced manufacturing investment around the region.</li><li>Retail, fashion and food brands with a Columbus origin story.</li><li>Research and innovation connected to Ohio State and the city's hospitals.</li><li>Logistics and distribution, supported by the city's central position in the Midwest.</li></ul><p>A strong story needs a reason to run now. We look for the timely detail in your business, such as an expansion, a launch, new jobs, a partnership or an informed view on the region's rapid growth.</p><h2 id=\"local-state-and-national-coverage-together\">Local, state and national coverage together</h2><p>Many Columbus businesses serve customers across Ohio and beyond, so we plan coverage in layers. The Columbus Dispatch, Columbus CEO and Columbus Monthly establish you at home. Placements in titles such as the Akron Beacon Journal, CantonRep or the Mansfield News Journal extend that reach to other Ohio communities. National business coverage then adds weight when you speak to investors, partners and customers in other states.</p><h2 id=\"how-it-works-with-dna\">How it works with DNA</h2><p>We begin with a conversation about your business and what you want coverage to achieve in Columbus and beyond. We then recommend the Ohio publications that fit, develop the angle and write the article in the style each title expects. You review the draft and approve every word. Once approved, we manage the placement through to publication and send you the live coverage. Plan for weeks rather than days.</p><h2 id=\"publications-we-place-in-columbus\">Publications we place in for Columbus</h2>\n<p>These are the Columbus titles we place clients in. Where a title has its own page, it explains what it publishes and how a feature there works.</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/the-columbus-dispatch\">The Columbus Dispatch</a></li><li><strong>Columbus Monthly</strong></li><li><strong>Columbus CEO</strong></li></ul>\n<h3>Across Ohio</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Cincinnati News</strong></li><li><strong>Akron Beacon Journal</strong></li><li><strong>CantonRep</strong></li><li><strong>Mansfield News Journal</strong></li><li><strong>News-Herald Ohio News</strong></li><li><strong>The Daily Record</strong></li><li><strong>Chillicothe Gazette</strong></li><li><strong>The Marion Star</strong></li><li><strong>Morning Journal</strong></li><li><strong>Zanesville Times Recorder</strong></li><li><strong>Kent Ravenna Record-Courier</strong></li><li><strong>Newark Advocate</strong></li><li><strong>Lancaster Eagle-Gazette</strong></li><li><strong>Times Reporter</strong></li><li><strong>The Alliance Review</strong></li></ul>\n<p>See every title we place in across the state on our <a href=\"/pr-in/ohio\">PR agency in Ohio</a> page.</p>\n<h2 id=\"frequently-asked-questions\">Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Do I need a Columbus PR agency to get local press?</h3><p>No. What matters is understanding Columbus and Ohio media and writing to each publication's standard. We work with Columbus businesses remotely and handle the whole process for you.</p><h3>How do I get featured in The Columbus Dispatch?</h3><p>Start with a timely story that matters to central Ohio readers, such as growth, new jobs, a product launch or a significant partnership. We develop it, write it to the paper's standard and manage the placement, and you approve the final text.</p><h3>What does a PR agency in Columbus do?</h3><p>It finds the newsworthy angle in your business, prepares articles for Columbus and Ohio publications and manages each placement. With DNA, you approve every word before anything goes live.</p>",
  "toc": [{"id": "who-pr-in-columbus-suits", "text": "Who PR in Columbus suits"}, {"id": "the-columbus-media-landscape", "text": "The Columbus media landscape"}, {"id": "what-stories-travel-in-columbus", "text": "What stories travel in Columbus"}, {"id": "local-state-and-national-coverage-together", "text": "Local, state and national coverage together"}, {"id": "how-it-works-with-dna", "text": "How it works with DNA"}, {"id": "publications-we-place-in-columbus", "text": "Publications we place in for Columbus"}, {"id": "frequently-asked-questions", "text": "Frequently asked questions"}],
