  "intro": "We help Nashville businesses get featured in The Tennessean and established papers across Tennessee. We develop the story, write it to each title's standard and manage the placement, and you approve every word.",
  "outlets": [],
  "body": "<p>A PR agency in Nashville helps your business stand out in a city that has grown quickly and attracts a great deal of attention. Done well, it puts a credible story about your company in front of Nashville customers, investors, partners and potential hires, in publications they already read, so your coverage carries weight rather than reading like a pitch.</p><p>Digital Networking Agency works with businesses in Nashville remotely. We develop the angle, write the article to each publication's standard, manage the placement and send it to you for sign-off, so you approve every word before it goes live. It is a straightforward way for a Nashville business to build recognised Tennessee coverage without an in-house press team.</p><h2 id=\"who-pr-in-nashville-suits\">Who PR in Nashville suits</h2><p>Nashville is known for music, but its economy is far broader, with healthcare, hospitality, education and a growing technology sector. The businesses that benefit most from coverage include:</p><ul><li><strong>Healthcare companies and health technology start-ups</strong> in a city with a large concentration of hospital management and health services firms.</li><li><strong>Music, entertainment and creative businesses</strong>, from studios and publishers to artist services.</li><li><strong>Hospitality, food and tourism businesses</strong> serving the many visitors who come to the city.</li><li><strong>Property, construction and home services firms</strong> meeting demand from people moving to Middle Tennessee.</li><li><strong>Professional firms and founders</strong> who want to be recognised as leaders in their field.</li></ul><h2 id=\"the-nashville-media-landscape\">The Nashville media landscape</h2><p>The Tennessean is Nashville's long-established daily newspaper and the title most Middle Tennessee readers associate with local news. It covers business, politics, music, sport and community life, and a well-written feature there gives a Nashville business a strong, shareable piece of credibility.</p><p>Around the city, a group of established papers serves fast-growing nearby communities. The Daily News Journal covers Murfreesboro and Rutherford County, The Leaf Chronicle serves Clarksville, and the Columbia Daily Herald reaches Maury County to the south. Further across the state, Knox News covers Knoxville and East Tennessee, the Commercial Appeal reports from Memphis and the Jackson Sun serves West Tennessee.</p><h2 id=\"what-stories-travel-in-nashville\">What stories travel in Nashville</h2><p>Nashville readers respond to stories about growth, creativity and the people building new businesses in the city. Angles we develop regularly include:</p><ul><li>Healthcare innovation and companies improving how care is organised and delivered.</li><li>Music and entertainment businesses, including the services behind the artists.</li><li>New restaurants, venues and hospitality concepts in a city with a busy visitor economy.</li><li>Relocations, expansions and new hiring by companies choosing Middle Tennessee.</li><li>Automotive and manufacturing work in the counties around the city.</li></ul><p>A strong story needs a timely reason to run. We look for the clear news in your business, such as a launch, a new location, a funding round, a partnership or an informed view on how the city's rapid growth affects housing and transport.</p><h2 id=\"local-state-and-national-coverage-together\">Local, state and national coverage together</h2><p>Many Nashville businesses serve customers across Tennessee and beyond, so we plan coverage in layers. The Tennessean establishes you at home. Placements in titles such as the Daily News Journal or The Leaf Chronicle reach the growing communities around the city, while Knox News and the Commercial Appeal carry your story to East and West Tennessee. National business coverage then adds weight with investors, partners and customers in other states.</p><h2 id=\"how-it-works-with-dna\">How it works with DNA</h2><p>We begin by understanding your business and what you want coverage to achieve in Nashville and beyond. We then recommend the Tennessee publications that fit, develop the angle and write the article in the style each title expects. You review the draft and approve every word. Once approved, we manage the placement through to publication and send you the live coverage. Expect weeks rather than days.</p><h2 id=\"publications-we-place-in-nashville\">Publications we place in for Nashville</h2>\n<p>These are the Nashville titles we place clients in. Where a title has its own page, it explains what it publishes and how a feature there works.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>The Tennessean</strong></li></ul>\n<h3>Across Tennessee</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Knox News</strong></li><li><strong>Commercial Appeal</strong></li><li><strong>Columbia Daily Herald</strong></li><li><strong>The Leaf Chronicle</strong></li><li><strong>Oakridger</strong></li><li><strong>Daily News Journal</strong></li><li><strong>Jackson Sun</strong></li></ul>\n<p>See every title we place in across the state on our <a href=\"/pr-in/tennessee\">PR agency in Tennessee</a> page.</p>\n<h2 id=\"frequently-asked-questions\">Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Do I need a Nashville PR agency to get local press?</h3><p>No. What matters is understanding Nashville and Tennessee media and writing to each publication's standard. We work with Nashville businesses remotely and handle the whole process for you.</p><h3>How do I get featured in The Tennessean?</h3><p>Start with a timely story that matters to Middle Tennessee readers, such as growth, new jobs, a launch or a community project. We develop it, write it to the paper's standard and manage the placement, and you approve the final text.</p><h3>What does a PR agency in Nashville do?</h3><p>It finds the newsworthy angle in your business, prepares articles for Nashville and Tennessee publications and manages each placement. With DNA, you approve every word before anything goes live.</p>",
  "toc": [{"id": "who-pr-in-nashville-suits", "text": "Who PR in Nashville suits"}, {"id": "the-nashville-media-landscape", "text": "The Nashville media landscape"}, {"id": "what-stories-travel-in-nashville", "text": "What stories travel in Nashville"}, {"id": "local-state-and-national-coverage-together", "text": "Local, state and national coverage together"}, {"id": "how-it-works-with-dna", "text": "How it works with DNA"}, {"id": "publications-we-place-in-nashville", "text": "Publications we place in for Nashville"}, {"id": "frequently-asked-questions", "text": "Frequently asked questions"}],
  "takeaways": ["The Tennessean is Nashville's established daily, and nearby papers such as the Daily News Journal and The Leaf Chronicle reach the growing suburbs.", "Stories about healthcare, music, hospitality and relocation tend to resonate most with Nashville readers.", "DNA develops the story, writes it to each publication's standard and manages the placement, and you approve every word before it goes live."],
