  "description": "A PR agency for Tucson businesses: we develop your story, write it to each title's standard and place it in Tucson and Arizona media, with your approval.",
  "intro": "Tucson has a close-knit business community and a local press that its readers genuinely follow. We work with businesses in Tucson to turn their work into coverage that customers, partners and the wider Southern Arizona community can find.",
  "outlets": ["arizona-daily-star"],
  "body": "<p>A PR agency in Tucson helps you get your business into the titles that Tucson and Southern Arizona readers trust, and into Arizona media that reaches further. In practice that means finding the story in what you already do, writing it in the style of a particular publication and placing it so it keeps appearing when people search for you.</p><p>We work with Tucson businesses remotely and look after every stage. We develop the story with you, write it to the publication's standard, manage the placement, and you approve every word before it goes live. You get coverage you can share with customers, add to grant and contract applications, and use to show that your business is part of the community.</p><h2 id=\"who-pr-in-tucson-suits\">Who PR in Tucson suits</h2><p>Tucson is a city where reputation travels by word of mouth, and good coverage strengthens that. PR in Tucson tends to suit:</p><ul><li>Aerospace, defence and optics companies and their suppliers</li><li>University spin-outs, research firms and health technology startups</li><li>Restaurants, chefs and food producers in a city celebrated for its food heritage</li><li>Tourism, outdoor and hospitality businesses built around the Sonoran Desert</li><li>Property, construction and professional firms serving the Foothills and the wider metro</li></ul><h2 id=\"the-tucson-media-landscape\">The Tucson media landscape</h2><p>The <strong>Arizona Daily Star</strong> is Tucson's long-established daily newspaper and the title most local readers turn to for news about the city. A story there carries weight with Tucson customers, institutions and employers alike.</p><p><strong>Tucson Weekly</strong> covers arts, food, music and city life, and suits restaurants, venues and creative businesses. For business readers, <strong>Inside Tucson Business</strong> follows the companies, deals and people shaping the local economy, while <strong>Foothills News</strong> reaches residents in the Catalina Foothills and nearby communities. We choose the title by who reads it, so an optics firm and a new taqueria each end up in front of the right audience.</p><h2 id=\"what-stories-travel-in-tucson\">What stories travel in Tucson</h2><p>Tucson's economy is shaped by the University of Arizona, a strong aerospace and defence sector, and a cluster of astronomy and optics companies that grew up around the region's observatories and dark skies. Its position near the Mexican border makes cross-border trade important, and its food culture, rooted in Sonoran traditions, has brought it international recognition as a city of gastronomy. The annual gem and mineral shows also bring buyers from around the world.</p><p>Stories that travel in Tucson tend to be rooted in place: a research idea becoming a company, a family restaurant keeping Sonoran recipes alive, an outdoor business built around the desert, or a manufacturer creating skilled jobs locally. Tucson readers care about the city's character, so we keep the focus on how your business fits into it.</p><h2 id=\"local-state-and-national-coverage-together\">Local, state and national coverage together</h2><p>Many Tucson businesses also sell to customers in Phoenix and across Arizona. A Tucson title builds trust at home, while <strong>Arizona Central</strong>, <strong>Business Journal Phoenix</strong> and community papers such as the <strong>East Valley Tribune</strong> reach readers in the Valley. We plan placements together, so a single story can give you a Tucson presence and statewide reach at the same time.</p><h2 id=\"how-it-works-with-dna\">How it works with DNA</h2><ul><li><strong>Story:</strong> we talk through your business and find the Tucson angle worth publishing.</li><li><strong>Writing:</strong> we draft the piece to the style and standard of the chosen title.</li><li><strong>Approval:</strong> you review and approve every word before it goes live.</li><li><strong>Placement:</strong> we manage the placement and send you the live article.</li></ul><p>Most placements take weeks rather than days, depending on the title and how quickly drafts are signed off.</p><h2 id=\"publications-we-place-in-tucson\">Publications we place in for Tucson</h2>\n<p>These are the Tucson titles we place clients in. Where a title has its own page, it explains what it publishes and how a feature there works.</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/arizona-daily-star\">Arizona Daily Star</a></li><li><strong>Tucson Weekly</strong></li><li><strong>Foothills News</strong></li><li><strong>Inside Tucson Business</strong></li></ul>\n<h3>Across Arizona</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>Business Journal Phoenix</strong></li><li><strong>Arizona Central</strong></li><li><strong>East Valley Tribune</strong></li><li><strong>The Mesa Tribune</strong></li><li><strong>West Valley View</strong></li><li><strong>Airpark News</strong></li><li><strong>Ahwatukee Foothills News</strong></li><li><strong>Phoenix College Times</strong></li><li><strong>City Sun Times</strong></li><li><strong>Peoria Times</strong></li><li><strong>Chandler News</strong></li><li><strong>Queencreek Tribune</strong></li><li><strong>The Foothills Focus</strong></li><li><strong>The Tempe Tribune</strong></li><li><strong>Phoenix New Times</strong></li></ul>\n<p>See every title we place in across the state on our <a href=\"/pr-in/arizona\">PR agency in Arizona</a> page.</p>\n<h2 id=\"frequently-asked-questions\">Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Do I need a local PR agency in Tucson?</h3><p>No. What matters is knowing Tucson's titles and writing to their standard. We work with Tucson businesses remotely, and the coverage reads the same to your customers.</p><h3>How do I get featured in the Arizona Daily Star?</h3><p>Start with a story that has a clear Tucson angle, such as local jobs, a new opening or a link to the university or the desert. We shape it, write it to the paper's standard and manage the placement, with your approval first.</p><h3>What does a Tucson PR agency do?</h3><p>A Tucson PR agency turns your business news into stories for local and Arizona titles and handles the placement, so you have coverage that builds credibility across Southern Arizona.</p>",
  "toc": [{"id": "who-pr-in-tucson-suits", "text": "Who PR in Tucson suits"}, {"id": "the-tucson-media-landscape", "text": "The Tucson media landscape"}, {"id": "what-stories-travel-in-tucson", "text": "What stories travel in Tucson"}, {"id": "local-state-and-national-coverage-together", "text": "Local, state and national coverage together"}, {"id": "how-it-works-with-dna", "text": "How it works with DNA"}, {"id": "publications-we-place-in-tucson", "text": "Publications we place in for Tucson"}, {"id": "frequently-asked-questions", "text": "Frequently asked questions"}],
