  "title": "PR Agency in Atlanta: Get Featured in Local Media",
  "description": "A PR agency for Atlanta businesses and founders. We develop your story and place it in Business Journal Atlanta and wider Georgia media you approve.",
  "intro": "Atlanta is home to some of the best-known companies in America and a fast-growing community of founders. A PR agency in Atlanta helps you tell a story that cuts through in a city full of ambitious businesses.",
  "outlets": ["atlanta-wire", "paste-magazine"],
  "body": "<p>A PR agency in Atlanta helps your business be seen in a city where household-name corporations and young companies compete for the same attention. It finds the angle that connects your work to Atlanta, from the jobs you create to the communities you serve, and places that story where local executives, customers and future hires will read it.</p><p>For Atlanta businesses, Digital Networking Agency develops the story with you, writes it to the publication's standard, manages the placement and asks you to approve every word before it goes live. The coverage then supports sales, partnerships, fundraising and recruitment.</p><h2 id=\"who-pr-in-atlanta-suits\">Who PR in Atlanta suits</h2><p>We work with businesses in Atlanta across the sectors that shape the city.</p><ul><li><strong>Fintech and payments companies</strong>, a long-standing Atlanta strength.</li><li><strong>Logistics, supply chain and transport firms</strong> in a city built around a major airport and rail links.</li><li><strong>Film, television, music and creative businesses</strong> in a city that has become a major centre for production.</li><li><strong>Healthcare, life sciences and university spin-outs</strong> connected to institutions such as Emory and Georgia Tech.</li><li><strong>Founders and executives</strong> building a profile in Atlanta's business community.</li></ul><h2 id=\"the-atlanta-media-landscape\">The Atlanta media landscape</h2><p>The Atlanta Journal-Constitution is the city's best-known daily newspaper. For company news, Business Journal Atlanta reaches owners, executives and investors across the metro area, and it suits stories about growth, hiring, investment and leadership. Atlanta Wire carries local business and community stories, which makes it a good fit for announcements with a clear local angle.</p><p>Atlanta is also a city of distinct neighbourhoods, from Buckhead and Midtown to the Westside and Decatur. A story that names the place and the people involved is far more likely to connect than one that speaks about the city in general terms.</p><h2 id=\"what-stories-travel-in-atlanta\">What stories travel in Atlanta</h2><p>Atlanta's economy draws on corporate headquarters, fintech, logistics, film and television, music, healthcare and higher education. Stories that tie a business to these themes tend to travel furthest.</p><ul><li><strong>Founder and community stories</strong>, including Black-owned businesses in a city with a deep history of Black entrepreneurship.</li><li><strong>Technology with a practical use</strong>, especially in payments, logistics and health.</li><li><strong>Creative industries</strong>, from production companies to music and fashion brands.</li><li><strong>Growth and relocation</strong>, as companies choose Atlanta for its talent and transport links.</li></ul><h2 id=\"local-state-and-national-coverage-together\">Local, state and national coverage together</h2><p>Many Atlanta businesses serve customers across Georgia and the South, so local coverage is often one part of a wider plan. A story in an Atlanta title can sit alongside coverage in the Savannah Morning News on the coast, The Augusta Chronicle in the east of the state or the Athens Banner-Herald for readers around the university town. For music, film and culture stories, Paste Magazine reaches a national audience interested in the arts. We plan the mix around where your customers actually are.</p><h2 id=\"how-it-works-with-dna\">How it works with DNA</h2><p>We work with Atlanta businesses remotely, so the process fits around your week. It has three steps.</p><ul><li><strong>Story development:</strong> we learn about your business and agree the angle that suits Atlanta readers.</li><li><strong>Writing:</strong> we write the piece to the standard and style of the target publication.</li><li><strong>Placement:</strong> we manage the placement, and you approve every word before it goes live.</li></ul><p>Most placements come together over weeks rather than days, depending on the title and the story.</p><h2 id=\"publications-we-place-in-atlanta\">Publications we place in for Atlanta</h2>\n<p>These are the Atlanta titles we place clients in. Where a title has its own page, it explains what it publishes and how a feature there works.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Business Journal Atlanta</strong></li><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/atlanta-wire\">Atlanta Wire</a></li></ul>\n<h3>Across Georgia</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/paste-magazine\">Paste Magazine</a></li><li><strong>Savannah Morning News</strong></li><li><strong>Athens Banner-Herald</strong></li><li><strong>The Augusta Chronicle</strong></li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"frequently-asked-questions\">Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Do I need a PR agency based in Atlanta?</h3><p>No. You need an agency that understands Atlanta media and the audiences behind each title. We work with Atlanta businesses remotely and shape every story around the city and its readers.</p><h3>How do I get featured in Atlanta business news?</h3><p>Start with a story that has a clear Atlanta connection, such as growth, hiring or a new product, and a reason to be told now. We develop the angle with you, write it to the publication's standard and manage the placement, with your approval on the final wording.</p><h3>What does an Atlanta PR agency do?</h3><p>It helps local businesses explain their work in a way that suits Atlanta media and places the story where the right readers will see it. With DNA, that means story development, writing, placement and your sign-off on every word.</p>",
  "toc": [{"id": "who-pr-in-atlanta-suits", "text": "Who PR in Atlanta suits"}, {"id": "the-atlanta-media-landscape", "text": "The Atlanta media landscape"}, {"id": "what-stories-travel-in-atlanta", "text": "What stories travel in Atlanta"}, {"id": "local-state-and-national-coverage-together", "text": "Local, state and national coverage together"}, {"id": "how-it-works-with-dna", "text": "How it works with DNA"}, {"id": "publications-we-place-in-atlanta", "text": "Publications we place in for Atlanta"}, {"id": "frequently-asked-questions", "text": "Frequently asked questions"}],
  "takeaways": ["We work with Atlanta businesses on stories shaped for readers of Business Journal Atlanta and Atlanta Wire.", "Corporate headquarters, fintech, logistics, film and television, music and healthcare give Atlanta companies strong angles.", "You approve every word before it goes live, and placements usually come together over weeks rather than days."],
