  "slug": "dubai",
  "region": "Dubai",
  "h1": "PR Agency in Dubai",
  "title": "PR Agency in Dubai: Get Featured in UAE and Gulf Media",
  "description": "A PR agency for Dubai businesses: we develop your story and place it in Dubai titles and Gulf publications such as Gulf News and Arabian Business.",
  "intro": "DNA PR works with businesses in Dubai that want to be covered in the city's own publications and in the business and lifestyle titles read across the UAE and the wider Gulf. We shape the story, write it to each publication's standard and manage the placement, and you approve every word.",
  "outlets": ["arabian-business", "dubai-weekly", "entrepreneur", "esquire-middle-east", "gulf-news", "harpers-bazaar-arabia"],
  "body": "<p>A PR agency in Dubai helps your business secure a place in the publications that residents, investors and visitors read. It finds the story in what you do, writes it to suit each outlet and manages the placement, whether that is a Dubai-focused title such as Dubai Business Journal or a regional name such as Gulf News, Arabian Business or Gulf Business.</p><p>In a city where many businesses compete for attention, credible coverage helps you stand apart. It reassures clients and partners, supports fundraising and gives new hires a reason to trust you. You stay in control throughout, and nothing is published until you have approved the final text.</p><h2 id=\"who-pr-in-dubai-suits\">Who PR in Dubai suits</h2><p>We work with businesses in Dubai across the city's main sectors. Founders setting up in free zones such as DIFC and DMCC use coverage to introduce themselves to the market. Real estate developers, brokers and property consultancies use it to build trust with buyers. Hospitality venues, beauty brands, fashion labels and wellness studios use it to reach residents and visitors who follow what is new in the city.</p><p>It also suits consultants, financial advisers, clinics and professional firms whose clients want reassurance before they commit, and international companies entering the UAE that need a credible local introduction.</p><h2 id=\"the-dubai-media-landscape\">The Dubai media landscape</h2><p>Dubai has a busy English-language media scene alongside Arabic-language outlets. City titles such as <strong>Eye of Dubai</strong>, <strong>Dubai Weekly</strong> and <strong>Dubai Business Journal</strong> cover local business, openings, people and lifestyle. <strong>Gulf News</strong>, published from Dubai, is one of the region's best-known English-language dailies, and Khaleej Times is another long-established name.</p><p>For business stories, Arabian Business and Gulf Business reach executives and investors across the Gulf. Lifestyle and luxury brands often look to Harper's Bazaar Arabia, Esquire Middle East or What's On Middle East, while Campaign Middle East covers the marketing and media industry itself.</p><h2 id=\"what-stories-travel-in-dubai\">What stories travel in Dubai</h2><p>Dubai has built its economy on trade, logistics, aviation, tourism and real estate. Jebel Ali port and the city's airports connect it to the world, and Emirates has made Dubai one of the busiest aviation hubs anywhere. Stories about growth, new ventures, international expansion and investment fit the city's outward-looking character.</p><p>Finance, fintech and professional services cluster around the Dubai International Financial Centre, while hospitality, retail and luxury are part of daily life. Readers respond to founder stories, new concepts in dining and wellness, sustainability efforts, and businesses that bring something genuinely new to the city.</p><h2 id=\"dubai-uae-and-regional-coverage-together\">Dubai, UAE and regional coverage together</h2><p>A strong Dubai campaign often works on several levels. A feature in a Dubai title builds recognition with local customers. A piece in Gulf News or Gulf Business reaches readers across the UAE. A profile in Arabian Business or Entrepreneur Middle East can carry your story to decision makers throughout the Gulf. We plan these placements together so each one supports the next.</p><h2 id=\"how-it-works-with-dna\">How it works with DNA</h2><p>We begin with your goals and the audiences you want to reach in Dubai and the region. Then we:</p><ul><li><strong>Develop the story</strong>, finding the angle that suits each audience and outlet.</li><li><strong>Write it to the publication's standard</strong>, matching the tone of local, business or lifestyle titles.</li><li><strong>Manage the placement</strong> from first draft to publication.</li><li><strong>Ask for your approval</strong>, because you sign off every word before it goes live.</li></ul><p>Campaigns usually take weeks rather than days, and we keep you updated at each stage.</p><h2 id=\"publications-we-place-in-dubai\">Publications we place in for Dubai</h2>\n<p>These are the Dubai titles we place clients in. Where a title has its own page, it explains what it publishes and how a feature there works.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Eye of Dubai</strong></li><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/dubai-weekly\">Dubai Weekly</a></li><li><strong>Dubai Business Journal</strong></li></ul>\n<h3>Across UAE</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/gulf-news\">Gulf News</a></li><li><strong>Grazia Magazine</strong></li><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/arabian-business\">Arabian Business</a></li><li><strong>Gulf Business</strong></li><li><strong>Business Traveller Middle East</strong></li><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/harpers-bazaar-arabia\">Harper's Bazaar Arabia</a></li><li><strong>What's On Middle East</strong></li><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/esquire-middle-east\">Esquire Middle East</a></li><li><strong>Campaign Middle East</strong></li><li><strong>Cosmopolitan Middle East</strong></li><li><strong>Masala</strong></li><li><strong>Emirates Woman &amp; Emirates Man</strong></li><li><strong>Dazed Middle East</strong></li><li><strong>Top Gear</strong></li><li><a href=\"/get-featured-in/entrepreneur\">Entrepreneur</a></li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"frequently-asked-questions\">Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Do I need a PR agency based in Dubai?</h3><p>Not necessarily. What matters is knowing which Dubai and Gulf titles suit your story and how to write for them. We work with Dubai businesses remotely and focus on the outlets your customers and investors read.</p><h3>How do I get featured in Dubai media?</h3><p>Start with a story that matters to people in the city, such as a launch, a founder journey or a new approach in your sector. We develop it, write it to each outlet's standard and manage the placement, and you approve the final version.</p><h3>What does a Dubai PR agency do?</h3><p>It finds the newsworthy angle in your business, writes the article, places it with suitable Dubai and regional publications and makes sure the published piece represents you accurately.</p>",
  "toc": [{"id": "who-pr-in-dubai-suits", "text": "Who PR in Dubai suits"}, {"id": "the-dubai-media-landscape", "text": "The Dubai media landscape"}, {"id": "what-stories-travel-in-dubai", "text": "What stories travel in Dubai"}, {"id": "dubai-uae-and-regional-coverage-together", "text": "Dubai, UAE and regional coverage together"}, {"id": "how-it-works-with-dna", "text": "How it works with DNA"}, {"id": "publications-we-place-in-dubai", "text": "Publications we place in for Dubai"}, {"id": "frequently-asked-questions", "text": "Frequently asked questions"}],
  "takeaways": ["Dubai campaigns often combine city titles such as Dubai Business Journal with regional names such as Gulf News, Arabian Business and Gulf Business.", "Trade, aviation, real estate, finance, hospitality and luxury give Dubai businesses strong story angles.", "DNA develops the story, writes it to each publication's standard and manages the placement, and you approve every word before it goes live."],
